Package: scorcher
Title: Declarative, Reproducible Workflows for Torch Models
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Scorcher", "authors", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Build, inspect, train, visualize, and snapshot graph-based
    torch models from R. Scorcher provides a pipeable model graph workflow
    with deterministic node naming, reusable architecture blocks, and
    reproducibility metadata for experiments and production workflows.
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
